{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54776","headline":"兵要望江南 占星第十三（京本列第五○四十三首） 三十五 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占星第十三（京本列第五○四十三首） 三十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"攻彼（京本作「破」）垒，月下见（京本作「列」）三星。\n城内诈降设（京本作「施」）巧计，急当准（京本作「整」）备出（京本作「突」）师征，莫信诈爲诚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54776.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54776","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}